WEBVTT

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.870
Raise the sails, you scalawags!

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.300
Show him the pirate spirit!

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.300
There are two grade 3s in the front row!

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.960
He's powered up to the max!

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.630
Can Aichi withstand this attack?!

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:24.940
Aichi...

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.450
Brother...

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.440
Two grade 3s...

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:24.130
Just a little while ago, I probably 
would've felt like fleeing.

00:02:24.130 --> 00:02:26.990
But no way am I gonna falter now!

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:32.820
Here I go!

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:35.350
Ruin Shade attacks Alfred!

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:38.050
And I activate its skill to power up, too!

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:42.760
There it is! Two cards from the 
deck go to the Drop Zone...

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.360
That adds another +2000 to its power.

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:45.560
Then...

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:50.310
I guard with Wingal!

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:01.170
Spirit Exceed, boosted by Evil Shade...

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:03.620
attacks Alfred!

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:05.760
I activate Evil Shade's skill.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:07.710
to increase Exceed's power!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.510
Twin drive, first check!

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:18.050
Second check!

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.150
Damage trigger check!

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:26.470
He has 4 damage!

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:31.640
I attack Alfred with Spirit Exceed, 
boosted by Guiding Zombie!

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.920
I guard with Elaine!

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.570
My turn ends.

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:53.750
I somehow kept the damage 
down to 1 that time!

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:55.260
Okay!

00:03:56.100 --> 00:03:58.950
Now it's my turn!

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:04.460
The Holy Dragon Descends

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.190
Let's go, everyone!

00:04:06.190 --> 00:04:06.810
Yeah!

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.120
I draw!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:12.410
I call the Solitary Knight, Gancelot!

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:18.940
So you've filled up your entire rear-guard...

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.980
Don't come at me with your maximum force!

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:24.240
Gallatin is powered up with 
a boost from Wingal...

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:28.240
and he attacks your Vanguard, Spirit Exceed!

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.240
I defend with Samurai Spirit!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:38.290
One more! I intercept with Ruin Shade!

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:46.140
Alfred attacks your Vanguard, Spirit Exceed!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:50.390
Alfred, Ultimate Power Up!

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:54.210
Brother's amazing...

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:56.590
It's like he's overflushing with drive...

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:59.020
That's <i>overflowing</i> with drive.

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:03.900
Something's different about him now...

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.470
I've noticed it, too.

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:09.120
He's become incredibly 
positive about the fight.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.640
You can get that just by looking at him.

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.800
Great sword attack!

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.820
Twin drive...

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:20.920
First!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:22.320
Second!

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:27.510
Damage check!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:31.310
Gordon's power increases 
with a boost from Marron...

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.510
and he attacks your Spirit 
Exceed one more time!

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.330
Damage check!

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:45.780
That's the end of my turn.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.100
Th-The Captain has 5 damage?!

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:53.060
That guy's still at 4 damage, ka-boom!

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.150
He's got my brother on the defensive?!

00:06:04.620 --> 00:06:07.700
Yes! I've got him cornered, 
with 1 point left!

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:13.890
You've become a good Fighter!

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:17.490
Doin' 5 points of damage 
to <i>me</i> is no small feat.

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:19.140
As a reward, I'll show you...

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:22.650
the true fearsomeness...

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:24.870
of the Pirate Band of the Abyss, Granblue!

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.910
That's an "Onslaught of Dragon Souls" card!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.680
Enter the fray from the Seven Seas!

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:38.110
I ride the King of Tyranny!

00:06:38.610 --> 00:06:41.550
King of Demonic Seas, Basskirk!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.690
Basskirk...

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.750
Soulcharge!

00:06:58.360 --> 00:07:03.560
After Soulcharging, Basskirk 
gains +2000 power!

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:06.110
I also activate Guiding Zombie's skill!

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:10.450
If I put him in the Soul, I can put three 
cards from the deck into the Drop Zone!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.780
Could he be...

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.410
Oh! He's...

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.980
You caught on? Here it comes...

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:17.160
A big move...

00:07:21.010 --> 00:07:23.090
That makes eight units in the Soul...

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:26.340
Watch Basskirk's demonic power!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.840
Counterblast!

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.400
And then, with eight units, Soulblast!

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:36.170
Sleeping warriors at the bottom of the sea!

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:38.940
In the name of the Devil 
King of the Sea, arise!

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:41.110
I activate Basskirk's skill!

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:44.810
Two Commodore Bluebloods...

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:46.890
and two Dandy Guy, Romarios...

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:48.810
go to the rear-guard circles!

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.390
Exceed exits the field.

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:01.540
Four units from the Drop 
Zone at the same time...

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.780
With this skill, I <i>could</i> 
resurrect up to five units,

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:07.040
but right now, this is plenty!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:10.220
<i>This</i> is the secret of the 
Pirate Band of the Abyss!

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:13.440
"The Power of Life or Death Dance"!

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:16.560
Tremble in fear! Ka-boom!

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:21.020
Awesome, isn't it? They're both wailing on 
each other and not backing down an inch!

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:24.940
In this fight, whoever runs out 
of stamina first will lose!

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:27.970
It's a done deal!

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:35.140
Brother! Please do your best!

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:37.030
I have to protect myself, no matter what!

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:42.950
Here I go! I attack Alfred with 
Bluebood, boosted by Romario!

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:45.210
I guard Alfred with Epona!

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.420
Basskirk is boosted by Evil Shade...

00:08:53.640 --> 00:08:55.440
and attacks Alfred!

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:57.680
I activate Evil Shade's skill!

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:07.400
I guard with Flash Shield, Iseult!

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:08.360
What?!

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:12.030
I activate Iseult's skill!

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:19.530
By discarding a Royal Paladin from my 
hand, Iseult can nullify an attack!

00:09:24.810 --> 00:09:26.380
Twin drive...

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:27.580
First check!

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:29.960
Second check!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:32.510
Critical trigger! In that case...

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.300
Commodore Bluebood!

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:39.110
I give you the +5000 power and critical +1!

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:42.580
Bluebood is boosted by Romario...

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:44.060
and attacks Alfred!

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:45.470
I guard with Wingal!

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:49.350
You can't stop Blueblood with <i>that</i>!

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:51.480
I intercept with the Knight of Truth, Gordon!

00:09:54.440 --> 00:10:00.950
If a Royal Paladin is in the Vanguard circle 
when Gordon intercepts, my shield is +5000!

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:08.960
My turn ends.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.610
I-I don't believe it!

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.880
He couldn't even give 1 
damage from that attack?!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.970
K-Ka-boom!

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:18.940
Aichi's doing great!

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:23.410
Hey, does Aichi have a twin brother?

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:25.750
Aichi and I are the only kids in our family.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:26.650
Oh, yeah?

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:32.680
Could that boy actually win this match?

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:36.130
Yeah. After all, his opponent 
already has 5 damage.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:37.650
It's too early to tell.

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:40.880
At a glance, it looks like 
this boy has the advantage.

00:10:40.880 --> 00:10:43.530
But the pirate could still win.

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:52.420
With that last attack, I made him use 
up most of the cards in his hand.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:57.130
If I get one more turn, 
he'll have no defense!

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.420
And <i>that's</i> when I'll strike!

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:01.510
So no matter what I do, I have to hold out...

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:03.390
'til the next turn!

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:08.520
This turn may be my last 
chance to beat Gouki...

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:10.160
He has just one point left...

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:11.690
I'm gonna win this with my next attack!

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.400
My Royal Paladin comrades...

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:17.260
And my Team Q4 teammates...

00:11:18.050 --> 00:11:21.970
I can't let them down!

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.410
What is this sensation...?!

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:51.480
What's wrong, Brother?!

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.430
He just...

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:57.060
It's like the cards called out to me.

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:00.390
Saying "Use me here!"

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:07.660
It's the perfect time to use this card!

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:09.500
All right!

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:14.090
God of the Knights, appear and 
muster your mystical power!

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:14.980
I ride...

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.460
Soul Saver Dragon!

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:28.300
Soul Saver Dragon?!

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:30.060
Brother, why...?!

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.310
Is something wrong?

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:35.810
I stopped him from putting that in the deck.

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:41.050
It was in his "Onslaught of Dragon 
Souls" booster pack, but...

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:47.320
Oh, that's an extremely strong card, but 
I really don't think you should use it.

00:12:47.320 --> 00:12:50.920
It's too difficult to suddenly master it...

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:55.200
Kamui tried to stop me...

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:58.360
but then, at that time...

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:02.070
I felt that sensation too...

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:13.140
As I trusted in that feeling...

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:16.500
Has that brought about my chance at winning?

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.990
Anyway, right now, I'm gonna 
make good use of this chance!

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:25.940
Soul Saver Dragon, five units Soulblast!

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:37.450
I activate Soul Saver Dragon's skill!

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:47.020
I give +5000 power to Gallatin!

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:49.840
I give +5000 power to Marron!

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:53.430
And I give +5000 power to Wingal!

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:56.500
He powers up his allies by <i>5000</i>?!

00:13:56.500 --> 00:14:00.170
That's Soul Saver Dragon's 
"Holy Charging Roar"!

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:03.740
Marron goes to the front. 
Gancelot exits the field!

00:14:03.740 --> 00:14:05.320
I call one more Marron!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:09.120
Then I attack your Basskirk with 
Wingal, boosted by Gallatin!

00:14:09.120 --> 00:14:10.950
I defend with Rough Seas Banshee!

00:14:12.490 --> 00:14:15.800
On top of that, I intercept 
with two Bluebloods!

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:26.760
I have to use too many cards to make 
up for my opponent's increased power!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:32.430
Soul Saver Dragon is boosted by Marron...

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:34.390
and he attacks Basskirk!

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:37.680
Also, I activate Soul Saver Dragon's skill!

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:45.040
When Soul Saver Dragon attacks a 
Vanguard, its power increases by +3000!

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:52.470
I defend with Gust Djinn!

00:14:56.840 --> 00:15:01.140
In exchange for discarding one unit from 
my hand, I can nullify your attack!

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.840
It's the same skill your Iseult has!

00:15:09.730 --> 00:15:11.800
Twin drive, first check!

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.040
As long as he doesn't draw a trigger here...

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.060
I can get through this fight!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.580
Second check!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.270
I activate stand trigger!

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:28.840
Gallatin rises once more...

00:15:28.840 --> 00:15:31.050
and I add +5000 to his power!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:34.200
His power...is <i>20000</i>?!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:43.790
I'm impressed. It's not so easy to 
block a Soul Saver Dragon's attack.

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:47.800
No matter what enemies come at 
him, a pirate never gives up!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:50.010
Marron attacks Basskirk!

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:53.550
I defend with Knight Spirit!

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:57.240
He almost had him!

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:58.310
Just a little more!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:08.460
That's our Captain! He totally 
blocked the attack! Ka-boom!

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:09.730
But look!

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:10.640
Ka-boom?

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:13.280
That kid can attack one more time!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.880
But our Captain...

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:19.970
used up his defending hand, 
and Blueblood is gone, too!

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:23.180
He can't do <i>anything</i>!

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:26.920
Gouki, here I go!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:30.150
I'm helpless...

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:32.950
But I ain't gonna run and hide!

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:34.760
That's how pirates are!

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.430
No guard!

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:42.430
Gallatin, give King of Demonic 
Seas, Basskirk, a proud defeat!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:43.880
Attack!

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:58.500
Damage check!

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:02.880
So this is as far as I go...

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.260
He did it!

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.170
Aichi!

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:17.890
I'm done.

00:17:18.690 --> 00:17:21.720
The winner is Aichi Sendou!

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:26.510
And so, the winner of the 3rd Kanto Region 
Vanguard Championship Tournament is...

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:28.990
Team Q4!

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:37.500
Kai, I did it. Thanks to you...

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.640
Thanks to my Q4 teammates...

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:45.290
and my Royal Paladin comrades...

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.850
I won!

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:49.500
Brother Aichi!

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.500
That was awesome, Brother!

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.460
You actually beat Gouki! You won!

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:54.850
Yesss!

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:56.220
Kamui...

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.340
We're going to the national tournament!

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:01.430
I never thought you'd get 
us this far, Aichi...

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:03.810
He did well, you know?

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:10.880
Thank God!

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:21.310
No, there's no way...

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:21.950
It's nonsense.

00:18:22.220 --> 00:18:25.170
Did you just say, "It's nonsense"?!

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:27.510
Kamui, I don't think he meant...

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:31.950
Hey, jerk! Brother just won! You think 
that's nonsense, you rotten...?!

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:33.270
Okay, okay!

00:18:35.010 --> 00:18:36.720
You...

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:40.450
What?! Now you're ignorin' me?!

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.600
I bet you <i>were</i> badmouthin' him!

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:43.540
Calm down, Kamui!

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:47.020
That strange sensation I felt then...

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:54.830
What was that?!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:58.130
Captain...

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.190
Captain!

00:19:00.190 --> 00:19:01.380
Stay away from me!

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:02.030
Ka...

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:06.870
Gettin' depressed over one 
match... That's no pirate!

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:10.210
Take a good look! <i>This</i> is a pirate's spirit!

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.410
Now that's our Captain!

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:17.810
I'll follow you 'til the day I die!

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:20.550
Me too, ka-boom!

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:23.120
Gouki...

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:25.510
Thank you!

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:28.060
It was a wonderful fight.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:30.580
I underestimated you.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:33.830
It's no wonder Kamui looks 
up to you as a "big brother".

00:19:34.280 --> 00:19:37.790
But I warn you, nationals 
aren't played at this level.

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:40.890
Train more and get stronger. You got me?

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:41.730
Yes!

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:46.460
Gouki...

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:48.170
Kamui...

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:53.110
N-Nagisa...

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:57.180
Team Q4 won, so I'm giving 
up on making you my husband.

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:58.750
Y-You understand?!

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:00.230
So instead...

00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:04.660
I'll become your wife!

00:20:07.720 --> 00:20:09.730
Congratulations, Nagisa!

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:12.100
It's time for Kamui the 
Great to pay the piper!

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:14.530
PP, yo!

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:18.910
Miss Emi, it's not what you think!

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.290
Wait, little sister!

00:20:22.290 --> 00:20:23.210
Big brother?!

00:20:23.210 --> 00:20:27.360
Kamui has nationals coming up. He 
doesn't have time to get married!

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:29.170
Gouki...

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:31.370
We'll have the ceremony <i>after</i> the tournament!

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:34.620
All right, big brother!

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:38.560
3rd Kanto Region Championship Tournament
Award Ceremony

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:37.280
No!!!

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:42.230
Congratulations!

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:43.140
Thank you.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:46.600
Do your best at the national championship!

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:47.980
I-I will!

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:51.270
How dare he get so close to my Kourin?!

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.180
Kamui, that little rat!

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.440
BB, yo!

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:58.320
Um... Back off, Brat...?

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.270
Okay?

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.570
Okay!

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:03.540
I hope you'll do well.

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:06.610
You too.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:08.160
Thank you!

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:11.570
Drop by the shop again sometime.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:19.050
All right! These four members of Team Q4 are 
going to participate in the national tournament!

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:21.720
Everyone, how about giving 
them a big round of applause?!

00:21:29.050 --> 00:21:30.970
Why'd it have to be Kamui...?

00:21:32.030 --> 00:21:33.810
Thanks, Brother!

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:38.610
Thanks to you, we can go to nationals!

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:40.520
From now, I'm gonna be on fire!

00:21:40.770 --> 00:21:44.570
Next time, I'm winning for sure, 
no matter how strong the opponent!

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.700
After that, we're getting married!

00:21:46.700 --> 00:21:48.150
Oh, shut up!

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:53.590
Incredibly strong Fighters 
gathering from all over Japan...

00:21:51.010 --> 00:21:53.130
National Tournament

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:56.040
That's the national tournament...

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:59.190
But I'm not gonna try to run away any more.

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:01.170
With my friends here...

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:05.950
and together with everyone in Team Q4...

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:09.300
I'm gonna give it my all!

00:23:51.660 --> 00:23:53.430
We won the regional championship!

00:23:53.430 --> 00:23:55.500
Brother, you're amazing! That was remarkable!

00:23:55.500 --> 00:23:57.870
Thanks! All of our hard efforts paid off!

00:23:57.870 --> 00:24:01.710
You've barely just started playing Vanguard, 
Brother, so to have beaten Gouki...

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:03.540
To be honest, it's a stunning upset!

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:06.110
All right! I'm gonna set my aim higher, too!

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:09.120
Brother, please take me to that one 
card shop, PSY, you were talking about!

00:24:09.120 --> 00:24:10.390
Uh... Sure.

00:24:10.390 --> 00:24:13.350
It seems like Morikawa wasn't 
able to find it, but...

00:24:13.350 --> 00:24:15.550
Next time: Fateful Encounter!

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:18.600
What? That person's image is in my head...?
